WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.279
The menu in Notes lists two dinners, Friday’s lunch and what’s already in the pantry.

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:08.637
Four people are coming on Thursday. Recalculate that dinner.

00:00:08.637 --> 00:00:13.293
Update the pantry with eight tortillas and two cans of black beans.

00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:18.332
Buy 8 tortillas and skip the beans. Copy the remaining items.

00:00:18.332 --> 00:00:21.115
The corrected shopping list is ready in Apple Notes.
